# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# contributor's platform or Git config. Every commit made against this repo
# on Windows previously warned "LF will be replaced by CRLF" -- this makes
# that warning (and the underlying inconsistency) go away rather than living
# with it indefinitely.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
